WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.837 --> 00:00:16.114
"Chuckles is a doll," Roxy said to Chuck.

2
00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:18.742
"A doll can't commit a crime."

3
00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:21.999
Detective Smith nodded. "Good point."

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.412
"Please believe me!" Chuck said.

5
00:00:24.413 --> 00:00:27.511
"Chuckles has a special computer chip in his back.

6
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:30.280
It was supposed to make him talk and be funny.

7
00:00:30.281 --> 00:00:34.222
Instead it made him . . . evil!"

8
00:00:34.223 --> 00:00:36.417
Detective Smith's phone rang.

9
00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:42.254
"Hello? Oh no! We're on our way!" He hung up.

10
00:00:42.255 --> 00:00:45.698
"Someone is robbing Downtown Toys."

11
00:00:45.699 --> 00:00:48.091
"Chuckles!" Chuck said.

12
00:00:48.092 --> 00:00:52.063
Roxy gulped. "My friends are there!"

13
00:00:52.064 --> 00:00:55.356
Roxy flew into Downtown Toys.

14
00:00:55.357 --> 00:00:57.688
Terrell peeked out from behind a shelf.

15
00:00:57.689 --> 00:00:59.880
He held a finger to his lips.

16
00:00:59.881 --> 00:01:02.818
Then he pointed toward the cash registers.

17
00:01:02.819 --> 00:01:06.214
Roxy saw a big doll standing on a cash register.

18
00:01:06.215 --> 00:01:09.385
"That must be Chuckles."

19
00:01:09.386 --> 00:01:13.588
Several other dolls were taking money from the cash registers.

20
00:01:13.589 --> 00:01:15.723
They stuffed the money into bags.

21
00:01:15.724 --> 00:01:18.410
The dolls looked old and valuable.

22
00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.686
"Those are the dolls from the doll show," Roxy thought.

23
00:01:21.687 --> 00:01:25.067
"Maybe Chuckles made them come to life!"

24
00:01:25.068 --> 00:01:31.197
Chuckles laughed. "I'm going to be rich, rich, rich!"

25
00:01:31.198 --> 00:01:34.433
"No, you're not!" Roxy shouted.

26
00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:38.308
"Rocket Girl!" Chuckles looked at the other dolls.

27
00:01:38.309 --> 00:01:43.944
"Attack!" The dolls dropped the money bags and rushed toward Roxy.

28
00:01:43.945 --> 00:01:47.074
"Uh-oh!" Roxy said as dolls grabbed her.

29
00:01:47.075 --> 00:01:51.962
"These dolls are valuable. I can't break them."

30
00:01:51.963 --> 00:01:54.050
Chuckles grabbed the money bag.

31
00:01:54.051 --> 00:02:00.085
"It's time for me to go, go, go!"

32
00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:03.168
Roxy almost stepped on one doll. "Whoops!"

33
00:02:03.169 --> 00:02:05.620
She stumbled and knocked over a candy display.

34
00:02:05.621 --> 00:02:07.704
It blocked the entrance.

35
00:02:07.705 --> 00:02:09.438
"Gah!" Chuckles said.

36
00:02:09.439 --> 00:02:12.754
"I'll find a back door." He ran off.

37
00:02:12.755 --> 00:02:15.026
Roxy managed to pull the dolls off her.

38
00:02:15.027 --> 00:02:16.830
Quickly she looked around.

39
00:02:16.831 --> 00:02:19.073
There was a cabinet under a cash register.

40
00:02:19.074 --> 00:02:21.981
She scooped up the dolls and stuffed them in the cabinet.

41
00:02:21.982 --> 00:02:26.883
Then she closed the door.

42
00:02:26.884 --> 00:02:31.822
Suddenly Roxy's watch beeped. "Terrell?"

43
00:02:31.823 --> 00:02:34.984
"I caught the big doll!" Terrell said.

44
00:02:34.985 --> 00:02:37.222
"We're in the doll department."

45
00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.782
"Let me go, kid!" Chuckles yelled in the background.

46
00:02:40.783 --> 00:02:44.746
"I'll be right there!" Roxy flew to the doll department.

47
00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:47.630
Boxes of dolls lined the shelves.

48
00:02:47.631 --> 00:02:50.632
Terrell was struggling with Chuckles.

49
00:02:50.633 --> 00:02:53.415
Roxy rushed over and pinned the doll to the floor.

50
00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:55.740
"Got you!" she said.

51
00:02:55.741 --> 00:03:01.171
"Dolls, alive!" Chuckles shouted.

52
00:03:01.172 --> 00:03:03.252
The doll boxes shook.

53
00:03:03.253 --> 00:03:05.593
"Uh-oh," Terrell said.

54
00:03:05.594 --> 00:03:08.803
A plastic fist popped out from one box.

55
00:03:08.804 --> 00:03:12.386
A tiny foot broke out from another box.

56
00:03:12.387 --> 00:03:15.986
Soon all the dolls were out of their boxes.

57
00:03:15.987 --> 00:03:18.717
"Attack!" Chuckles yelled.

58
00:03:18.718 --> 00:03:21.717
Angry dolls dived onto Roxy and Terrell.

59
00:03:21.718 --> 00:03:24.100
The dolls punched and kicked.

60
00:03:24.101 --> 00:03:26.645
"Ouch!" Terrell cried.

61
00:03:26.646 --> 00:03:29.657
Tiny plastic hands grabbed at Roxy.

62
00:03:29.658 --> 00:03:33.185
Chuckles slipped from her grip and laughed.

63
00:03:33.186 --> 00:03:37.909
"I am bad, bad, bad!"
